          "groundingSupports": [
            {
              "segment": {
                "endIndex": 342,
                "text": "When selecting a consultancy in Adelaide for **business workflow automation** and **Microsoft Power Automate implementation**, the right fit depends largely on the size of your organisation, whether you need enterprise-level governance (Center of Excellence), and your integration requirements (e.g., SharePoint, Dynamics 365, or legacy ERPs)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                0,
                1,
                2
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 530,
                "endIndex": 625,
                "text": "**Focus:** Mid-market, local councils, healthcare, and enterprise business process digitisation"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3,
                4
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 635,
                "endIndex": 735,
                "text": "**Why them:** Headquartered on South Terrace in Adelaide, Comunet has over 30 years of local history"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3,
                4
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 737,
                "endIndex": 927,
                "text": "They excel at Microsoft Modern Workplace transformations, using Power Automate, Power Apps, and SharePoint to replace manual paperwork, approval bottlenecks, and disconnected legacy routines"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3,
                5
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 938,
                "endIndex": 1069,
                "text": "**Best for:** Organisations wanting a local, hands-on partner for end-to-end process digitisation and practical workflow automation"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1109,
                "endIndex": 1212,
                "text": "**Focus:** Enterprise architecture, state government, utilities, and large-scale digital transformation"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                6,
                7,
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1222,
                "endIndex": 1417,
                "text": "**Why them:** Chamonix is an Adelaide-founded consulting powerhouse known for architecting large, complex solutions (regularly trusted by SA Water, SA Health, and other SA Government departments)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                6,
                8,
                9
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1419,
                "endIndex": 1615,
                "text": "If your workflow automation requires rigorous security frameworks, integration into complex data environments, or cloud architecture, their senior consultants are among the best in South Australia"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1625,
                "endIndex": 1751,
                "text": "**Best for:** Complex, regulated environments and public sector organisations requiring enterprise-grade solution architecture"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8,
                9
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1783,
                "endIndex": 1873,
                "text": "**Focus:** Small to mid-sized businesses (SMBs) and mid-market modern workplace automation"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                10,
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1883,
                "endIndex": 2103,
                "text": "**Why them:** Based in Eastwood and Mount Barker, Concept Data specialises in deploying practical Microsoft Power Platform solutions, including Power Automate flows, SharePoint structure design, and custom front-end apps"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12,
                13,
                14
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2105,
                "endIndex": 2219,
                "text": "They focus on eliminating operational friction and routine manual data entry without over-engineering the solution"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2473,
                "endIndex": 2544,
                "text": "**Focus:** Enterprise, education, and government digital transformation"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                2
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2554,
                "endIndex": 2741,
                "text": "**Why them:** As one of Microsoft’s largest and most accredited Solutions Partners in Australia, Data#3 has an extensive dedicated Business Applications and Modern Work team in Adelaide"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                2,
                15
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2743,
                "endIndex": 2972,
                "text": "They do more than just build individual flows; they help organisations implement **Center of Excellence (CoE)** governance models, manage Power Automate licensing, and deploy Robotic Process Automation (RPA) and AI Builder models"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                0,
                2
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2982,
                "endIndex": 3112,
                "text": "**Best for:** Enterprise-wide automation rollouts where data loss prevention (DLP), governance, and licensing control are critical"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                16,
                2,
                17
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3168,
                "endIndex": 3244,
                "text": "**Focus:** Large commercial, government, and council workflow modernisations"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                18,
                19
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3254,
                "endIndex": 3322,
                "text": "**Why them:** Datacom has a significant footprint in South Australia"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                19
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3324,
                "endIndex": 3563,
                "text": "Their local Information Management and Intelligent Workplace consultants specialise in building robust automation pipelines—connecting Microsoft 365, Dataverse, Copilot Studio, and Power Automate to orchestrate multi-department processes"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                1,
                20,
                18
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3573,
                "endIndex": 3669,
                "text": "**Best for:** Large organisations looking for high-capacity delivery and ongoing managed support"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                20,
                21
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3734,
                "endIndex": 3815,
                "text": "**Focus:** Employee experience, Modern Work, and collaboration-centric automation"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                22,
                23
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3825,
                "endIndex": 3964,
                "text": "**Why them:** A premier Microsoft Modern Work partner across Australia, Engage Squared focuses heavily on human-centred workflow automation"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                22,
                24
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3966,
                "endIndex": 4154,
                "text": "If your workflow challenges centre around Microsoft Teams approvals, SharePoint records management, or employee lifecycle workflows, they are market leaders in driving actual user adoption"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                25,
                26
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4164,
                "endIndex": 4268,
                "text": "**Best for:** People-driven workflows, approval chains, and governance-heavy document management systems"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                25,
                26,
                24
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4404,
                "endIndex": 4484,
                "text": "Unregulated Power Automate implementations can cause \"flow sprawl\" and shadow IT"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                16,
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4486,
                "endIndex": 4552,
                "text": "Ensure they establish an Environment and DLP strategy from day one"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                16
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4614,
                "endIndex": 4728,
                "text": "If your workflows need to interact with modern APIs (like Xero, Salesforce, or Microsoft 365), Cloud Flows suffice"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                25
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4730,
                "endIndex": 4861,
                "text": "If you need to interact with legacy on-premise software without APIs, verify their experience with **Power Automate Desktop (RPA)**"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                0
              ]
            }
